1671178526-558,https://www.hrw.org/news?country%5B9648%5D=9648&keyword=&page=25,Syria: Civilians at Risk as Aleppo Siege Tightens,https://www.hrw.org/news/2016/07/22/syria-civilians-risk-aleppo-siege-tightens,Syria: Civilians at Risk as Aleppo Siege Tightens,Government Should Urgently Allow Aid into Opposition-Held Areas,null,null,"Click to expand Image
          




  
        
                      
      
