Changes to the political landscape since the adoption of Protocol III will likely facilitate more constructive dialogue and legal reform. Forty-three states selected the experts who participated in the last Conference of Government Experts in 1976,[85] and only 50 states signed the CCW in its first year. As of October 2017, 120 states are party to the CCW, and 115 are party to Protocol III in particular.[86] The increase in states parties means that more countires will be part of the discussions on incendiary weapons at the 2017 Meeting of States Parties.,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
